#flag
Pennon: long narrow flag on lance

Sun in splendour: sun with human face and alternating straight/wavy rays
- Sun of May: Rio de la Plata countries
Cross of Burgundy: red saw-toothed diagonal cross, Spain + Spanish Netherlands
Eagle of Saladin: some Arabic countries

cross
saltire = diagonal cross
pale = vertical band
fess = horizontal band
bar = multiple horizontal bands
bend = diagonal band
chevron = V-shaped
pall = Y-shaped
or = gold
argent = silver

